<urn:sha256:719e8970c121e017bed9858dc31420732c9723ab85ad70d7ce3315083ed3651c> <urn:ledger:ns#statement> "A watched-not-grounding edge is a distinct edge type, revisit_if: this claim's death reopens the decision; it is not the decision's ground. It is filed as its own edge with its own vocabulary, never inside based_on, and a status movement on it produces a reopen finding, never a basis-loss one." .
